*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0016
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-04-17 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 950
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0016.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY INT0016C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 IR-RT              PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 2000-RATE-TIER
    DISPLAY "IR-RT=" IR-RT
    STOP RUN.
2000-RATE-TIER.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> TOP SAVINGS TIER
        WHEN IN-A-TY = 'S'
           AND IN-L-BL >= 100000
            MOVE 0.0475 TO IR-RT
        *> MIDDLE SAVINGS TIER
        WHEN IN-A-TY = 'S' AND IN-L-BL >= 20000
            MOVE 0.0375 TO IR-RT
        WHEN IN-A-TY = 'S'
            MOVE 0.0300 TO IR-RT
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0050 TO IR-RT
    END-EVALUATE.
